.TH AVR\-BILLING\-INVOICES\-LIST 1 "" "avr 0.1.4" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-billing-invoices-list \- List invoices.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr billing invoices list
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List invoices.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS
    created_at, currency, has_pdf, invoice_id, period_end, period_start,
    status, subtotal_cents, tax_cents, total_cents
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-L\fR, \fB\-\-limit\fR \fIINTEGER RANGE\fR
Max invoices to return. (default: 50)
.TP
\fB\-\-cursor\fR \fITEXT\fR
Pagination cursor from a previous response.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-billing-invoices (1),
.BR avr-billing-invoices-download (1),
.BR avr-billing-invoices-show (1)
